@ShopEasy.API_HostAddress = http://localhost:5091

### 1. Get all products
GET {{ShopEasy.API_HostAddress}}/api/products
Accept: application/json

### 2. Get product by ID
GET {{ShopEasy.API_HostAddress}}/api/products/1
Accept: application/json

### 3. Search products by keyword
GET {{ShopEasy.API_HostAddress}}/api/products/search?query=watch
Accept: application/json

### 4. Search products with category filter
GET {{ShopEasy.API_HostAddress}}/api/products/search?query=&category=Electronics
Accept: application/json

### 5. Get categories
GET {{ShopEasy.API_HostAddress}}/api/products/categories
Accept: application/json

### 6. Checkout cart simulation
POST {{ShopEasy.API_HostAddress}}/api/orders/checkout
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{
